  >>> matrix_55 = tf.random.normal(shape=[1, 3, 5, 5])
  >>> operator_55 = tf.linalg.LinearOperatorFullMatrix(matrix_55)

  Combine to create a [2, 3] batch of 9 x 9 operators:
  >>> operator_99 = LinearOperatorBlockLowerTriangular(
